                "metadata": {
                    "author": "The Wiggles",
                    "category": "music",
                    "previewAudio": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0051/8845/2401/files/wiggle-up-giddy-up.mp3",
                    "description": "Yeehaw! The Wiggles are going country with their groundbreaking new album, Wiggle Up, Giddy Up!—a toe-tapping, heartwarming celebration of music, friendship, and fun.  This all-new collection features never-before-heard songs from country legends like Dolly Parton and Lainey Wilson, plus exciting collaborations with stars including Morgan Evans, Dasha, MacKenzie Porter, Jackson Dean, and even the masked cowboy himself, Orville Peck!  \n\nFrom the high-energy anthem ‘Let’s Ride!’ to the sweet and emotional ‘It’s Tough Being Three Years Old’, this album blends The Wiggles’ signature joy with the storytelling magic of country music. There’s even a special reimagining of ‘Rock-a-Bye Your Bear' with MacKenzie Porter, and a powerful message of love and belonging in ‘Friends of Dorothy’.  \n\nWith appearances from country icons like Slim Dusty and a lineup full of surprises, Wiggle Up, Giddy Up! is packed with heart, rhythm, and unforgettable melodies. Whether you're dancing in the living room or riding in the car, this is a musical adventure the whole family will love.",
                    "audioPreviewUrl": "https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/cards/73KG1/preview wiggle up giddy up-1.mp3",
